#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:3
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_UPDATE_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED - ACIDIC]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Acidic Growth. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Union and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:8
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_UPDATE_OE_ACID_DOUBLE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED X2 - ACIDIC]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Acidic Growth. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Union and its allies.\n"
"\tFor your extra egregious actions, your reputation was decreased twice."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:14
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_UPDATE_OE_ACID_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED - ACIDIC]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Acidic Growth. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Union and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:18
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_UPDATE_OE_ACID_FIGHT\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:24
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_REMOVE_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION INCREASED - ACIDIC]\n"
"\tYou have done a good deed here in the eyes of the Acidic Growth. If you've lost reputation from other actions in the past, you're more likely to be forgiven for them."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:29
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_REMOVE_OE_ACID_DOUBLE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION INCREASED X2 - ACIDIC]\n"
"\tYou have done a good deed here in the eyes of the Acidic Growth. If you've lost reputation from other actions in the past, you're more likely to be forgiven for them.\n"
"\tFor your big contribution, your reputation was increased twice."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:35
msgid ""
"data/events_special_morality.xml.append$//event[@name=\"MORALITY_REMOVE_OE_ACID_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION INCREASED - ACIDIC]\n"
"\tYou have done a good deed here in the eyes of the Acidic Growth. If you've lost reputation from other actions in the past, you're more likely to be forgiven for them."

#: src-en/data/events_special_morality.xml.append:39
msgid ""
